    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** CyPath® Lung, a noninvasive early-stage lung cancer diagnostic, is gaining strong commercial traction. Unit sales more than doubled in early 2026, driven by accelerating physician uptake and wider clinical use. Management expects the growth trajectory to steepen through the year as awareness campaigns broaden adoption. The test targets a significant unmet need in early detection, though competitive dynamics and broader macro influences are not detailed in current commentary.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is executing targeted commercial initiatives to amplify CyPath’s reach, while a recent equity offering bolsters the balance sheet to fund expansion. The swift pace of adoption signals early execution credibility, though the raise introduces modest dilution and points to ongoing capital needs. Sustaining the ramp and converting awareness into durable utilization will be important tests of the strategy’s effectiveness.",
